        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I store my household goods in a secure facility before the final move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our 24/7 CCTV‑monitored warehousing in Bokaro offers short‑term and long‑term storage solutions. Goods are stacked on pallets, wrapped with our 7‑layer protection, and tracked via GPS tags. You receive a separate storage invoice that complies with IBA billing standards.</p>
